n went through directly. I never saw a code-owner approval step, though policy requires one for merges into main. Check that it was recorded, or get a code owner to sign off after the fact.\n\nI also couldn't confirm the policy itself: looking up FIN-212 returned \"Unknown advisory.\" The fix matches the existing comment and the test, but if you need it traced to the policy, check the correct ID.", "type": "text"}]}]}